ISNETEFATURA_ENV=Environment
ISNETEFATURA_ENVHelp=Test: İşNet sandbox. Prod: live environment (URLs provided by İşNet).
ISNETEFATURA_COMPANY_VKN=Company tax number (VKN)
ISNETEFATURA_COMPANY_VKNHelp=Leave empty to use Prof ID 1 from Company setup.
ISNETEFATURA_VENDOR_NUMBER=Vendor / branch number
ISNETEFATURA_VENDOR_NUMBERHelp=İşNet CompanyVendorNumber. Empty for most companies.
ISNETEFATURA_URL_INVOICE_TEST=InvoiceService URL (test)
ISNETEFATURA_URL_INVOICE_TESTHelp=e-Fatura and e-Arşiv submission, search, document links.
ISNETEFATURA_URL_ADDRESSBOOK_TEST=AddressBookService URL (test)
ISNETEFATURA_URL_ADDRESSBOOK_TESTHelp=Taxpayer lookup (GetTaxPayer), tax office / city lists.
ISNETEFATURA_URL_INVOICE_PROD=InvoiceService URL (prod)
ISNETEFATURA_URL_INVOICE_PRODHelp=Provided by İşNet at go-live.
ISNETEFATURA_URL_ADDRESSBOOK_PROD=AddressBookService URL (prod)
ISNETEFATURA_URL_ADDRESSBOOK_PRODHelp=Provided by İşNet at go-live.
ISNETEFATURA_TIMEOUT=Timeout (s)
ISNETEFATURA_TIMEOUTHelp=SOAP request timeout. Minimum 10.
ISNETEFATURA_DEBUG=Verbose logging
ISNETEFATURA_DEBUGHelp=When on, full SOAP request/response XML is written to dolibarr.log and to the attempt record. Troubleshooting only.

ISNETEFATURA_AUTOSEND_ON_VALIDATE=Send automatically on validation
ISNETEFATURA_AUTOSEND_ON_VALIDATEHelp=On: the invoice is submitted to İşNet the moment it is validated ("Validate + Send"). Off: submit manually from the e-Invoice tab.
ISNETEFATURA_BLOCK_VALIDATE_ON_ERROR=Block validation on send error
ISNETEFATURA_BLOCK_VALIDATE_ON_ERRORHelp=On: if İşNet rejects the document the invoice stays draft (validation rolled back). Off: the invoice is validated, flagged as failed, and can be resent later.
ISNETEFATURA_TAXPAYER_LOOKUP=Taxpayer lookup
ISNETEFATURA_TAXPAYER_LOOKUPHelp=How to decide e-Fatura vs e-Arşiv for a receiver. "Every submission": query the GİB registry each time. "Cache": store the answer on the third-party card until it expires. "Never": rely solely on the third-party card field.
ISNETEFATURA_TAXPAYER_CACHE_DAYS=Cache lifetime (days)
ISNETEFATURA_TAXPAYER_CACHE_DAYSHelp=Cache mode only. 0 = re-query every time.
ISNETEFATURA_REQUIRE_TAX_OFFICE=Tax office required
ISNETEFATURA_REQUIRE_TAX_OFFICEHelp=On: receivers with a 10-digit VKN must have Prof ID 2 (tax office) filled in, otherwise submission is blocked.
ISNETEFATURA_DOMESTIC_COUNTRY=Domestic country code
ISNETEFATURA_DOMESTIC_COUNTRYHelp=Receivers in this country are domestic (TEMEL/TİCARİ); all others use the export scenario.

ISNETEFATURA_DEFAULT_SCENARIO=Default scenario
ISNETEFATURA_DEFAULT_SCENARIOHelp=For domestic e-Fatura. TİCARİ: receiver may accept/reject within 8 days. TEMEL: no response flow. Can be overridden per invoice.
ISNETEFATURA_DEFAULT_UNIT=Default unit code
ISNETEFATURA_DEFAULT_UNITHelp=Used when a Dolibarr unit cannot be mapped to a UN/ECE code. C62 = piece.
ISNETEFATURA_BANK_ACCOUNT=Bank account for IBAN
ISNETEFATURA_BANK_ACCOUNTHelp="Bank account of the invoice": whatever is selected on the invoice. A fixed account prints the same IBAN on every document.
ISNETEFATURA_ZERO_VAT_EXEMPTION_CODE=Default VAT exemption code
ISNETEFATURA_ZERO_VAT_EXEMPTION_CODEHelp=Used for invoices with 0%% VAT lines when no code is set on the invoice (GİB code list, e.g. 351). If empty here and on the invoice, submission is blocked.
ISNETEFATURA_ZERO_VAT_EXEMPTION_REASON=Default VAT exemption reason
ISNETEFATURA_ZERO_VAT_EXEMPTION_REASONHelp=Text printed next to the code.
ISNETEFATURA_EARSIV_SEND_MAIL=E-mail e-Arşiv invoices
ISNETEFATURA_EARSIV_SEND_MAILHelp=On: when the third party has an e-mail, İşNet mails the invoice automatically (SendMailAutomatically).
ISNETEFATURA_NOTE_PREFIX=Fixed invoice note
ISNETEFATURA_NOTE_PREFIXHelp=Added as the first note line of every e-document. The invoice's public note is appended.

